<p>Salaami har taraf mehshar bapa hai <br />
wafaate hazrate qairunnisa hai</p>

<p>yahi aati hai har chakki se aawaaz<br />
batoole paak faqre aasiya hai</p>

<p>malak aate nahi be izn ghar me<br />
ya qadre ahlebaithe mustafa hai</p>

<p>payamber ko jo roti thi shabo roz<br />
usi ko aaj kunba ro raha hai</p>

<p>kaha hyder se zahra ne ye rokar<br />
ke saath apna tumhaara choot'ta hai</p>

<p>meri do betiyaa'n hai aur do bete <br />
yateemi ka har ek ko saamna hai</p>

<p>garebaa'n chaak hai sibtaine ahmad<br />
sare hyder pa kohe gham gira hai</p>

<p>Ali ki betiyaa'n sar peet'ti hai<br />
janaza ghar se zahra ka chala hai<br />
</p>
